(text "R410–R415 are 0 ohm tuning links on the six quad-NOR lines. C420 sits at U1.39 and C421 at U9.8." (at 16 158.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 8ae57788-14fc-5d96-92a3-1c957a2ae60d))
(text "Y1 CL is 10 pF. The initial equal 15 pF loads assume 2.5 pF board stray capacitance. Verify oscillator startup and frequency on prototypes." (at 16 163.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 57b2276a-13af-5c86-880c-56230ff95cb3))
(text "L402 is required on XTAL_P for ESP32-S31 normal startup. R403 on LCD_R4 is also required for this 3.3 V flash." (at 16 168.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 929f275d-d78b-58fa-ac96-f4827ab3800d))
